consumption in kBTU/year; and provide equipment ratings, and calculations that demonstrate the generation capacity of the system in kBTU/year 
for thermal and kwh for electricity.</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Provide documentation that renewable energy development at the Installation level is planned.</OLI><BRK/></OLG>
<BRK/></SPT>
</SPT></TAI><TAI OPT="DESIGN-BUILD"><SPT><TTL>Solar Domestic Hot Water (SDHW)</TTL><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  This paragraph is tailored for DESIGN-BUILD.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<BRK/>
<TXT>For the submittal documentation below, demonstrate compliance with <RID>UFC 1-200-02</RID>.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<SPT><TTL>Design Submittal Documentation</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide life-cycle cost analysis (LCCA).  When found to be LCCE, provide design drawings and calculations that demonstrate total on-site renewable 
energy as an annual percentage of proposed building energy consumption in kBTU/year; and provide equipment ratings, and calculations that demonstrate 
the generation capacity of the system in kBTU/year for thermal.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
</SPT></TAI><SPT><TTL>Building-level Power Metering</TTL><BRK/>
