<BRK/></SPT>
</SPT><SPT><TTL>Outdoor Water Use</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>When there is no permanent irrigation system beyond plant establishment period, this element is met.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Where new irrigation is required beyond plant establishment period, provide only non-potable sources.  Provide meters.  Provide the requirements 
