<BRK/>
<OLI>Project Owner Organization: US Army, US Air Force, US Navy or US Marine Corps</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Primary Contact, Project Owner: Executing DOD Service's Project Manager or Design Manager</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Building Owner Organization: US Army, US Air Force, US Navy or US Marine Corps</OLI><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<OLI>Building Owner Organization Project Number</OLI><BRK/>
<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
